request.description:
**Event name:** `send_message`

Send a new text chat message.

**Payload:**
```
{
  chatRoomId: number;
  message?: string;
  file_url?: string;
  type: "TEXT" | "IMAGE" | "FILE";
}
```

**Server behavior:**
- Verifies authenticated user.
- Verifies user belongs to the room.
- Saves message in database.
- Broadcasts saved message to everyone in the room via `new_message`.

**Important:** Treat `new_message` as confirmation the message was saved/delivered — `send_message` does not currently use acknowledgement callbacks.
